<title>USA: Lockheed Martin unit wins AEGIS work.</title>
<headline>Lockheed Martin unit wins AEGIS work.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Navy said Wednesday it has awarded a $120-million contract increase to Lockheed Martin Government Electronic Systems to provide engineering and computer programming for basic computer program development for AEGIS ship defense weapons systems.</p>
<p>It said the work is to completed at Moorestown, N.J. by March 2000.</p>
